                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "ygysR",
                  "name": "gap 16",
                  "width": 1,
                  "height": 16,
                  "layout": "vertical"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "f71F2g",
                  "name": "Coding agents are brilliant inside a ter",
                  "fill": "$lp-muted-fg",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Coding agents are brilliant inside a terminal and blind outside of it. They write code that would take you hours, but they can't see what they built. Can't click a button. Can't run the tests and react to what happens.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.7,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-landing",
                  "fontSize": 15,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "sEt2T",
                  "name": "gap 16",
                  "width": 1,
                  "height": 16,
                  "layout": "vertical"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "JOSHk",
                  "name": "So you sit there closing the loop manual",
                  "fill": "$lp-muted-fg",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "So you sit there closing the loop manually. Copy the error. Paste it back. Agent fixes it. Check again. Open the browser. Screenshot. Paste. Fix. Check. Create a PR. Wait for CI. It's red. Copy the logs. Paste. Fix. CI again.",
