                  "gap": 8,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "sO9JB",
                      "name": "Five kinds, one list",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 2,
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "hxfTu",
                          "name": "h",
                          "fill": "$text-primary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Five kinds, one list",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                          "fontSize": "$text-sm",
                          "fontWeight": "500"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "htBGQ",
                          "name": "d",
                          "fill": "$text-muted",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Today the rail mixes app preferences, your identity, agent credentials, a per-repo config and a device pairing — and shows them as nine equal rows. You have to read all nine to find where an API key lives.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                          "fontSize": 10,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "B0uku",
                      "name": "AGENT ACCESS is the real group",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 2,
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "RFlVr",
                          "name": "h",
                          "fill": "$text-primary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "AGENT ACCESS is the real group",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                          "fontSize": "$text-sm",
                          "fontWeight": "500"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "HdQuB",
                          "name": "d",
                          "fill": "$text-muted",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Providers, GitHub, Browser and Cloud are all the same question: what is the agent allowed to use, and with whose credentials. Grouping them is why the duplicate GitHub App card and the split Claude credential become obvious rather than invisible.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                          "fontSize": 10,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "fSKk3",
                      "name": "Environment is not an app setting",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "gap": 2,
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "F4JtKs",
                          "name": "h",
                          "fill": "$text-primary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "Environment is not an app setting",
                          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                          "fontSize": "$text-sm",
                          "fontWeight": "500"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "TzHsX",
                          "name": "d",
                          "fill": "$text-muted",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "It is per-repository — it already carries its own repo picker inside a global settings page, which is the smell. Either it gets its own group, or it moves onto the repository where the repo is already chosen. I would move it.",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                          "fontSize": 10,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "kl7ZE",
