                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "The rail mixes your identity, agent credentials, a per-repository config, app preferences and a device pairing — and presents all five as equal siblings. Grouping is the cheapest fix in the whole revamp.",
