                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "50 · Account is one card. Cursor puts identity in the sidebar header; do the same and the section disappears. Board 59 kept an ACCOUNT group holding Account and Devices — with identity in the header that group has one child left, so Devices moves to APP and three groups remain.",
