                  "fill": "$text-tertiary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 1180,
                  "content": "Three defects run through every settings page, and none of them are about the nav. Type hierarchy is inverted — a 12px label above a 13px description. Controls stretch the full body width, so a one-word value gets a mile of empty select. And five different container grammars draw the same section. This board fixes the row first, then the section, then rebuilds two pages on top of them.",
