                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": "fill_container",
                              "content": "Four of the five wrap rows in a box. The box adds a border, a radius and a padding value that then has to be decided again on the next page — which is exactly how 52, 53 and 54 ended up with four different paddings for the same card. The top-rule section has nothing to decide: a rule, a gutter, rows. It is already the grammar on the six newest boards.",
